# Time Stop cast in the declare attackers step ends the turn in combat (CR 724.1d): the attacking Llanowar Elves are
# removed from combat, so no combat damage is dealt and Bot2 stays at 20. Shore Up's +1/+1 "until end of turn" was on the
# Elves (a 2/2 as it attacks); the turn's cleanup step still happens, so the effect ends (CR 514.2) and the Elves are a 1/1
# on Bot2's turn 4, the next turn.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Island
Shore Up
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Sol Ring
Time Stop
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Shore Up.Cast(Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Attack(Llanowar Elves > Bot2)
? Combat.Attackers.Count = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Power = 2
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Time Stop.Cast
[T4 Bot2.Upkeep]
? ActivePlayer = Bot2
? Combat.Attackers.Count = 0
? Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Power = 1

[Expect]
Turn = 4
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Toughness = 1
Exile = Time Stop
Bot1.Graveyard = Shore Up
